            "growth_value": {
              "inputFields": [
                {"namespace": "sec_edgair", "name": "base.conformed_facts", "field": "val"}
              ],
              "transformationType": "INDIRECT",
              "transformationDescription": "yoy_change: current_val - prior_val. yoy_pct_change: (current - prior) / abs(prior). cagr_5yr: (current / base)^(1/5) - 1. Skips zero/negative base for pct_change/CAGR respectively."
